=== Test 10: Error — WHERE on child table ===
Expected error: WHERE conditions on joined tables are not yet supported.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: WHERE conditions on joined tables are not yet supported. Only the root table (first in FROM) may be filtered.

=== Cleanup ===
